<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th" class="h-full">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>นักปราชญ์เพลงพื้นบ้าน (Multiplayer & Leaderboard) - วรรณกรรมท้องถิ่น ม.4-ม.6</title>
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Prompt:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Sarabun:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- FontAwesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Canvas Confetti CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/canvas-confetti@1.6.0/dist/confetti.browser.min.js"></script>

    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        thai: {
                            gold: '#D97706',
                            goldLight: '#FBBF24',
                            amberDark: '#78350F',
                            terracotta: '#9A3412',
                            warmBg: '#FFFDF9',
                            cardBg: '#FFFFFF',
                            green: '#10B981',
                            red: '#EF4444',
                            purple: '#8B5CF6'
                        }
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        prompt: ['Prompt', 'sans-serif'],
                        sarabun: ['Sarabun', 'sans-serif']
                    },
                    boxShadow: {
                        'thai-soft': '0 10px 25px -5px rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.15), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.08)',
                        'glow-gold': '0 0 25px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4)',
                        'glow-red': '0 0 25px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4)'
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Sarabun', sans-serif;
            background-color: #FFFDF9;
            background-image: radial-gradient(#F3E8FF 0.8px, transparent 0.8px), radial-gradient(#FEF3C7 0.8px, #FFFDF9 0.8px);
            background-size: 32px 32px;
            background-position: 0 0, 16px 16px;
        }

        h1, h2, h3, h4, .font-prompt {
            font-family: 'Prompt', sans-serif;
        }

        .glass-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border: 1.5px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2);
        }

        .option-btn {
            transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
        }
        .option-btn:hover:not(:disabled) {
            transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.01);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px -4px rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.25);
        }

        @keyframes shake {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); }
            20%, 60% { transform: translateX(-10px); }
            40%, 80% { transform: translateX(10px); }
        }
        .animate-shake {
            animation: shake 0.4s ease-in-out;
        }

        @keyframes comboPop {
            0% { transform: scale(0.5); opacity: 0; }
            50% { transform: scale(1.3); opacity: 1; }
            100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
        }
        .animate-combo {
            animation: comboPop 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
        }

        @keyframes heartPulse {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
            50% { transform: scale(1.25); }
        }
        .animate-heart-danger {
            animation: heartPulse 0.8s infinite ease-in-out;
        }

        @keyframes floatSlow {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-8px); }
        }
        .animate-float {
            animation: floatSlow 3.5s infinite ease-in-out;
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 6px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #FEF3C7;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #D97706;
            border-radius: 9999px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="h-full text-slate-800 flex flex-col min-h-screen selection:bg-amber-200">

    <!-- TOAST NOTIFICATION CONTAINER -->
    <div id="toast" class="fixed top-5 right-5 z-50 transform translate-y-[-100px] opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 pointer-events-none">
        <div class="bg-slate-900 text-white px-5 py-3 rounded-2xl shadow-xl flex items-center gap-3 border border-amber-400">
            <i id="toast-icon" class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-amber-400 text-xl"></i>
            <span id="toast-message" class="text-sm font-semibold font-prompt">แจ้งเตือน</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- HEADER / NAVIGATION -->
    <header class="w-full bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-amber-200/80 sticky top-0 z-40 shadow-sm">
        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-2.5 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-amber-500 to-orange-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xl shadow-md shadow-orange-500/20">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-music"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h1 class="text-base md:text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-800 leading-tight">นักปราชญ์เพลงพื้นบ้าน</h1>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-amber-700 font-semibold">วรรณกรรมท้องถิ่น ม.๔ - ม.๖ (Multiplayer Edition)</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <!-- Sound Toggle -->
                <button id="sound-btn" onclick="toggleSound()" class="p-2 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-100/70 text-amber-800 transition-colors" title="เปิด/ปิด เสียง">
                    <i id="sound-icon" class="fa-solid fa-volume-high text-lg"></i>
                </button>
                <!-- Leaderboard Modal Trigger -->
                <button onclick="openLeaderboardModal()" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 hover:bg-amber-200 text-amber-900 text-xs md:text-sm font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5 transition">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-trophy text-amber-600"></i>
                    <span class="hidden sm:inline">ตารางคะแนน</span>
                </button>
                <!-- Knowledge Base Trigger -->
                <button onclick="openKnowledgeModal()" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 hover:from-amber-600 hover:to-orange-600 text-white text-xs md:text-sm font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-sm transition">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-book-open"></i>
                    <span class="hidden sm:inline">คลังความรู้</span>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- MAIN GAME CONTAINER -->
    <main class="flex-grow flex items-center justify-center p-3 md:p-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto w-full">

        <!-- 1. START SCREEN (With Name Registration) -->
        <section id="start-screen" class="w-full space-y-6 animate-fadeIn">
            <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-10 shadow-thai-soft border border-amber-300/80 relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-orange-500 to-red-500"></div>

                <div class="text-center space-y-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto pt-2">
                    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-100/80 text-amber-900 text-xs md:text-sm font-bold border border-amber-200">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-users text-orange-500"></i>
                        <span>โหมดแข่งขันออนไลน์ & สะสมความรู้</span>
                    </div>

                    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-slate-800 tracking-tight leading-tight">
                        ศึกนักปราชญ์ <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-600 via-orange-600 to-red-600">"เพลงพื้นบ้านไทย"</span>
                    </h1>

                    <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-50 to-orange-50 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 text-left md:text-center shadow-inner">
                        ท้าประลองความรู้กับเพื่อนๆ ในชั้นเรียน! มีเวลา <strong>๑๕ วินาที</strong> ต่อข้อ สะสมคอมโบ x3 และแบ่งปัน <strong>"สรุปความรู้"</strong> ขึ้นกระดานผู้นำออนไลน์!
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- PLAYER NAME INPUT -->
                <div class="max-w-md mx-auto my-6 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/70 border border-amber-300/80 space-y-2">
                    <label for="player-name-input" class="block text-xs font-extrabold text-amber-900 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-user-pen text-amber-600"></i>
                        <span>กรอกชื่อ-นามสกุล หรือชื่อเล่นของคุณก่อนเริ่ม</span>
                    </label>
                    <input type="text" id="player-name-input" placeholder="เช่น 01-สมชาย สายร้อง ม.5/1" class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border border-amber-300 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-500 focus:outline-none font-semibold text-slate-800 placeholder-slate-400 text-sm shadow-sm transition">
                </div>

                <!-- Start Action Buttons -->
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3 pt-2">
                    <button onclick="checkAndStartQuiz()" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-10 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-orange-500 to-red-500 hover:from-amber-600 hover:to-red-600 text-white font-prompt font-extrabold text-lg shadow-lg shadow-orange-500/30 transform active:scale-95 transition flex items-center justify-center gap-3 group">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-play text-xl"></i>
                        <span>เข้าสู่การแข่งขัน!</span>
                    </button>
                    <button onclick="openLeaderboardModal()" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-white hover:bg-amber-50 text-amber-900 border border-amber-300 font-prompt font-bold text-base shadow-sm transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-trophy text-amber-500"></i>
                        <span>ดูตารางคะแนนสด</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- 2. QUIZ INTERFACE -->
        <section id="quiz-screen" class="w-full hidden space-y-4">
            <!-- Dashboard Bar -->
            <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-4 shadow-sm border border-amber-300/80 space-y-3">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
                    <!-- Player Tag & Lives -->
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <div class="bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 px-3 py-1 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold border border-amber-300 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-user text-amber-700"></i>
                            <span id="active-player-tag">ผู้เล่น</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-1 bg-red-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-xl border border-red-200">
                            <div id="lives-container" class="flex gap-1">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-heart text-red-500 text-sm"></i>
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-heart text-red-500 text-sm"></i>
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-heart text-red-500 text-sm"></i>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Combo Badge -->
                    <div id="combo-badge" class="hidden px-3 py-1 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-yellow-400 to-orange-500 text-slate-900 font-black text-xs shadow-md animate-combo flex items-center gap-1">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-fire text-amber-900"></i>
                        <span id="combo-multiplier-text">COMBO x1.5!</span>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Current Score -->
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-amber-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-xl border border-amber-300">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-star text-amber-500 text-sm"></i>
                        <span id="current-score" class="font-extrabold text-amber-900 text-base">0</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Per-Question Timer -->
                <div class="space-y-1">
                    <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-bold text-slate-600">
                        <span id="question-counter" class="text-amber-800">ข้อ 1/12</span>
                        <span id="timer-text" class="font-mono text-orange-600 font-extrabold">⏱️ 15s</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="w-full bg-slate-100 h-3 rounded-full overflow-hidden p-0.5 border border-slate-200 shadow-inner">
                        <div id="timer-bar" class="bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 via-amber-500 to-orange-500 h-full rounded-full transition-all duration-1000 ease-linear w-full"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Lifelines Row -->
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-1 border-t border-slate-100">
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500">ตัวช่วย:</span>
                    <div class="flex gap-2">
                        <button id="lifeline-5050" onclick="useLifeline5050()" class="px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-indigo-50 hover:bg-indigo-100 border border-indigo-200 text-indigo-700 font-bold text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5 transition disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-scissors"></i>
                            <span>50/50</span>
                        </button>
                        <button id="lifeline-freeze" onclick="useLifelineFreeze()" class="px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-cyan-50 hover:bg-cyan-100 border border-cyan-200 text-cyan-700 font-bold text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5 transition disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-snowflake"></i>
                            <span>แช่แข็งเวลา (+10s)</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Question & Choices Card -->
            <div id="quiz-card" class="glass-card rounded-3xl p-5 md:p-8 shadow-thai-soft border border-amber-300 relative">
                <div id="question-category" class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 text-xs font-bold mb-3 border border-amber-200">
                    หมวดหมู่
                </div>

                <h2 id="question-text" class="text-base md:text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-800 leading-snug mb-5">
                    ข้อความคำถาม...
                </h2>

                <div id="options-container" class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3">
                    <!-- Choices injected here -->
                </div>

                <div id="explanation-box" class="hidden mt-5 p-4 rounded-2xl border transition-all duration-300">
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                        <div id="explanation-icon" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-white font-bold text-sm">
                        </div>
                        <div class="space-y-1">
                            <h4 id="explanation-title" class="font-bold text-sm md:text-base">คำอธิบาย</h4>
                            <p id="explanation-text" class="text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed"></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-4 flex justify-end">
                        <button id="next-btn" onclick="nextQuestion()" class="px-6 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-black text-white font-prompt font-bold text-sm shadow-md transition flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span>ข้อถัดไป</span>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- 3. RESULT & SUBMISSION SCREEN -->
        <section id="result-screen" class="w-full hidden space-y-6">
            <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-10 shadow-thai-soft border border-amber-300 text-center space-y-6 relative overflow-hidden">
                <div id="result-top-bar" class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500"></div>

                <div class="relative inline-block mt-2">
                    <div id="rank-badge-bg" class="w-24 h-24 md:w-28 md:h-28 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-amber-400 to-yellow-300 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto shadow-lg animate-float">
                        <i id="rank-icon" class="fa-solid fa-trophy text-white text-4xl md:text-5xl drop-shadow-md"></i>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-1">
                    <span id="result-subtitle" class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-700 tracking-wider uppercase">สรุปผลการทดสอบ</span>
                    <h2 id="rank-title" class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-black text-slate-800">
                        ปรมาจารย์เพลงพื้นบ้าน
                    </h2>
                    <p id="rank-message" class="text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-600 max-w-lg mx-auto">
                        คำอธิบายสรุปผล...
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Stats Grid -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 md:gap-4 max-w-md mx-auto">
                    <div class="p-3 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200">
                        <span class="block text-[11px] text-amber-800 font-bold">คะแนนรวม</span>
                        <span id="final-score" class="text-lg md:text-2xl font-black text-amber-900">0</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-3 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200">
                        <span class="block text-[11px] text-emerald-800 font-bold">ตอบถูก</span>
                        <span id="final-correct" class="text-lg md:text-2xl font-black text-emerald-900">0/12</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-3 rounded-2xl bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200">
                        <span class="block text-[11px] text-purple-800 font-bold">คอมโบสูงสุด</span>
                        <span id="final-combo" class="text-lg md:text-2xl font-black text-purple-900">x1</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- SUBMISSION FORM (Name Confirm & Reflection Box) -->
                <div class="max-w-lg mx-auto bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-amber-300 text-left space-y-4 shadow-sm">
                    <h3 class="font-extrabold text-sm md:text-base text-amber-950 flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-amber-200 pb-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane text-amber-600"></i>
                        <span>บันทึกคะแนน & สรุปความรู้ขึ้นตารางผู้นำ</span>
                    </h3>

                    <div class="space-y-1">
                        <label for="final-player-name" class="block text-xs font-bold text-amber-900">ยืนยันชื่อผู้เล่น:</label>
                        <input type="text" id="final-player-name" class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-amber-300 bg-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-500 focus:outline-none text-sm font-semibold">
                    </div>

                    <div class="space-y-1">
                        <label for="reflection-input" class="block text-xs font-bold text-amber-900">สรุปความรู้หรือสิ่งที่ได้เรียนรู้จากเกมนี้ (สรุปคร่าวๆ):</label>
                        <textarea id="reflection-input" rows="3" placeholder="เช่น ได้รู้ว่าเพลงเรือและลำตัดเป็นของภาคกลาง ใช้สัมผัสกลอนหัวเดียว และเน้นความสนุกสนานโดยไม่ใช้เครื่องดนตรีใหญ่..." class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-amber-300 bg-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-500 focus:outline-none text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 placeholder-slate-400"></textarea>
                    </div>

                    <button id="submit-score-btn" onclick="submitScoreToFirebase()" class="w-full py-3 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-teal-600 hover:from-emerald-700 hover:to-teal-700 text-white font-prompt font-extrabold text-sm shadow-md transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-cloud-arrow-up"></i>
                        <span>ส่งคะแนนและสรุปความรู้</span>
                    </button>
                </div>

                <!-- Answers Review Accordion -->
                <div class="pt-2 border-t border-slate-100">
                    <button onclick="toggleAnswerReview()" class="text-xs md:text-sm text-amber-800 hover:text-amber-900 font-bold underline inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-list-check"></i>
                        <span>ดูเฉลยและทบทวนคำตอบทุกข้อ</span>
                    </button>
                    
                    <div id="answers-review-container" class="hidden mt-4 text-left space-y-3 max-h-64 overflow-y-auto pr-1">
                        <!-- Dynamic answers review -->
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Thank You & View Leaderboard Actions (Play Again button removed) -->
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 pt-2">
                    <div id="thank-you-msg" class="w-full p-4 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-100 via-orange-100 to-amber-100 border border-amber-300 text-amber-950 font-bold text-center text-sm md:text-base flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-inner">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-heart text-red-500 text-lg"></i>
                        <span>ขอบคุณที่ร่วมสนุกและทดสอบความรู้</span>
                    </div>
                    <button onclick="openLeaderboardModal()" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 hover:from-amber-600 hover:to-orange-600 text-white font-prompt font-extrabold text-sm shadow-md transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-trophy text-yellow-200"></i>
                        <span>ดูตารางคะแนนออนไลน์</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

    </main>


    <!-- LEADERBOARD MODAL (Firestore Real-time Data) -->
    <div id="leaderboard-modal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 hidden flex items-center justify-center p-3 md:p-4">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl max-w-2xl w-full max-h-[90vh] flex flex-col shadow-2xl overflow-hidden animate-fadeIn">
            <!-- Modal Header -->
            <div class="p-4 md:p-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-600 via-orange-600 to-amber-700 text-white flex items-center justify-between">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-white/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-trophy text-yellow-300 text-xl"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-extrabold text-lg md:text-xl leading-tight">ตารางคะแนนและสรุปความรู้สด</h3>
